          <name>BASEBAND_ERROR_STATUS%s</name>
          <description>Project-assigned name. First three words sampled by the bounded four-entry hal_ifc_get_bb_err_bitmap loop. Bit 16 contributes the corresponding output bitmap bit.</description>
