            <field>
              <name>APEP_LENGTH</name>
              <description>Project-assigned name. Sixteen-bit assembled HE APEP byte count produced by libpp[pp_he.o]::ppCalTxHEAMPDULength or libpp[pp_he.o]::ppCalTxHESMPDULength and copied by libpp[hal_mac_tx.o]::mac_tx_set_hesig. For A-MPDU, DMA metadata byte seven bit zero contributes the four-byte hardware HE-Control insertion without changing the low fourteen-bit MPDU length. The qualified S-MPDU value is 32 bytes: four-byte delimiter plus 24-byte MPDU, four-byte hardware FCS slot and alignment.</description>
              <bitOffset>11</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>16</bitWidth>
              <writeConstraint>
                <range>
                  <minimum>0</minimum>
                  <maximum>65535</maximum>
                </range>
