        <register>
          <name>CONTROL</name>
          <description>Project-assigned name. Complete hal_set_sta_tsf asserts bit four after writing both station TSF value words; the SoftAP path of complete hal_mac_tsf_reset asserts bit five after clearing both shared TSF value words; complete libpp[hal_tsf.o]::hal_get_sta_tsf sets then clears bit zero around its snapshot reads. Complete libpp[hal_mac.o]::hal_get_tsf_time selects station with bit zero or SoftAP with bit one, reads the shared snapshot words, then clears that selector through a fresh-read RMW. The whole select/read/release transaction must be serialized across TSF domains.</description>
