              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>SNAPSHOT_SOFTAP_TSF</name>
              <description>Project-assigned name. SoftAP TSF-1 snapshot selector. Complete libpp[hal_mac.o]::hal_get_tsf_time with a nonzero argument sets this bit, reads SNAPSHOT_HIGH then SNAPSHOT_LOW, and clears this bit through a fresh-read RMW. Both readback words are shared with the station snapshot; this selector does not establish on-air beacon or probe-response timestamp insertion.</description>
