          <description>Project-assigned name. Complete hal_set_sta_tbtt_interval replaces bits 25:0 with its 32-bit argument shifted right by ten and preserves bits 31:26. Complete hal_set_sta_tbtt performs the same update from its third argument, and tsf_hal_get_tbtt_interval reads the interval back as this field shifted left by ten.</description>
