        <register>
          <name>CONTROL</name>
          <description>Project-assigned name. Complete hal_enable_mac clears bits 7:4 in one fresh-read RMW before publishing its interrupt-mask argument; complete hal_disable_mac sets the same four bits. Complete esp_test_clr_hw_statistics independently asserts bit 16 around the separate 0x20104308 bit-zero clear pulse, then clears bit 16.</description>
