              <description>Project-assigned name. Enabled by the cold MAC mask 0x19a879e0 and observed asserted with RX_SUCCESS throughout sustained HE20 receive traffic. Complete libpp[wdev.o]::wDev_ProcessFiq acknowledges this bit as part of the full STATUS image but does not dispatch independent work for it. Its hardware meaning and independent transition rules remain unknown; software must not treat it as RX ownership or work multiplicity.</description>
              <bitOffset>24</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
            </field>
