      <description>Narrow owner for the otherwise unbounded word at 0x20101FF0. Complete
ESP32-S31 BLE PHY initialization writes complete image zero followed by
complete image one before touching any other radio register. The same ordered
writes appear at the same block offset in the named ESP32-C61 counterpart, but
neither artifact proves this word's hardware action or membership in the
adjacent BTMAC dump range. No wider peripheral extent is claimed.
