ESP32-S31 BLE PHY initialization writes complete image 0x20 before initializing
the BLE hardware accelerator and complete image 0x40 after the surrounding
BTMAC and accelerator sequence. The register's physical block, hardware action
and the meanings of the two images remain unproved, so no neighboring
0x201088xx words are absorbed.
